摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"One-click portable launcher for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) Web UI on Windows. Auto-installs Node.js and dsh with China mirror fallback, 3-stage progress with retries and resume, zero-download fast path when ready. No admin needed.","id":"gh:1333327284","install_available":false,"language":"Batchfile","name":"dsh-portable-launcher","slug":"15828148/dsh-portable-launcher","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"One-click portable launcher for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) Web UI on Windows. Auto-installs Node.js and "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"dsh with China mirror fallback, 3-stage progress with retries and resume, zero-download fast path wh"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"en ready. No admin needed."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Web UI Portable Launcher"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"One-click launcher for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) Web UI on Windows.\nZero-config for end users: it aut"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"o-installs a portable Node.js and the `dsh` package when missing, then starts the local\nWeb UI at `h"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ttp://127.0.0.1:3080`."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Unofficial community project.** Not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek AI.\n> The `deepse"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ek.ico` icon uses the DeepSeek logo, © DeepSeek."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **3 major stages with live progress**: `[1/3]` Node.js check → `[2/3]` dsh package check → `[3/3]`"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" launch\n- **Zero-download fast path**: when everything is already installed, launch is direct — no d"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ownloads, no registry checks\n- **Automatic portable Node.js install** (no admin required; portable m"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ode - no registry or system PATH changes, everything stays inside the package folder)\n- **Automatic "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"dsh install** via a local `npm install --prefix` into the package folder (no global install, no syst"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"em changes; China npm mirror fallback on retries)\n- **Up to 3 retries per step** with clear prompts,"},{"id":"p6s7","text":" then concrete manual instructions\n- **Resume support**: close the window mid-setup, run again — it "},{"id":"p6s8","text":"continues from where it stopped\n- Boot-time log (`dsh-startup.log`) written next to the launcher\n- 6"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"4-bit check, writable-folder check, port-conflict handling"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Windows 10/11 x64\n- Node.js is **not** required — it is downloaded automatically if missing"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. Download `dsh-web-ui-portable.zip` from Releases and extract it anywhere\n(e.g. `D:\\` or Desktop —"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" **not** Program Files)\n2. Run `setup.bat` once — creates a desktop shortcut \"DSH Web UI\" with the i"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"con\n3. Double-click **DSH Web UI** (or `dsh-web.bat`)\n4. First run: press `Y` if asked to download N"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ode.js; downloads take a few minutes\n5. Add your own DeepSeek API key in the UI Settings (platform.d"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"loads take a few minutes\n5. Add your own DeepSeek API key in the UI Settings (platform.deepseek.com)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Checks for Node.js v22+; if missing or too old, downloads the latest LTS `win-x64` portable build\n"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"from npmmirror (fallback: nodejs.org) and extracts it next to the launcher — portable mode, no\nregis"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"try or system PATH changes, PATH is set for the session from a local marker file\n- Checks for the `d"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"sh` package; if missing, runs `npm install --prefix \"<folder>\\dsh-local\" @deepseek-ai/dsh`\n(local in"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"stall, no global changes)\n- Launches `dsh web`; a background helper polls `http://127.0.0.1:3080` an"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"d opens the browser when ready\n- Progress state lives in marker files next to the launcher (`node/`,"},{"id":"p12s7","text":" `dsh-ready.txt`, `dsh-startup.log`),\nwhich is what makes resume and the zero-download fast path pos"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"-ready.txt`, `dsh-startup.log`),\nwhich is what makes resume and the zero-download fast path possible"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Privacy"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- No telemetry, no analytics, nothing phone-home by the launcher itself\n- Your API key is stored by "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"dsh in `%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh\\.credentials.yaml` — never in this folder\n- The launcher only downloads: "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"Node.js LTS from npmmirror/nodejs.org, and `@deepseek-ai/dsh` from the npm registry"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The zip contains `使用说明.txt` (Chinese) and `README-EN.txt` (English) with the full FAQ: SmartScreen p"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"rompts,\nWeChat file corruption, folder-not-writable, port 3080 in use, slow first run, and more. If "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"something fails, the window\nshows `[1/3] [2/3] [3/3]` stage markers and tells you exactly what to do"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" — or open an issue with the window content."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"MIT — see LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
